{"title":"Iron Warmace","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Weapon Smithing Lv 13)</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Weapon Smithing at level 13 <span class=\"muted\">(523 XP)</span> from 7× <a href=\"#/item/iron-bar\">Iron Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/weapon-smithing\">Weapon smithing</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/iron-warmace\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/iron-warmace?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/iron-warmace?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/iron-warmace?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/iron-warmace?q=ordinary\">Ordinary</a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/iron-warmace?q=good\">Good</a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/iron-warmace?q=excellent\">Excellent</a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/iron-warmace?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/iron-warmace?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"iron-warmace\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"destruction\">Destruction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"burn\">Flame</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"freeze\">Freezing</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"shock\">Storm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"corrode\">Corrosion</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Damage below is the weapon alone, before your stats and enchantments.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>vs Ordinary</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/iron-warmace?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/c50f7826f0e8f3250cc6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>3–15.7 damage</td><td>-4 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/iron-warmace?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/c50f7826f0e8f3250cc6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>3.4–18 damage</td><td>-2.7 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/iron-warmace?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=\"data/img/c50f7826f0e8f3250cc6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></td><td>-10%</td><td>3.8–20.2 damage</td><td>-1.3 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/iron-warmace?q=ordinary\" title=\"Show it at Ordinary\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/c50f7826f0e8f3250cc6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></td><td>0%</td><td>4.2–22.5 damage</td><td>0 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/iron-warmace?q=good\" title=\"Show it at Good\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/c50f7826f0e8f3250cc6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></td><td>+10%</td><td>4.6–24.7 damage</td><td>+1.3 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/iron-warmace?q=excellent\" title=\"Show it at Excellent\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/c50f7826f0e8f3250cc6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></td><td>+22%</td><td>5.1–27.4 damage</td><td>+2.9 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/iron-warmace?q=superior\" title=\"Show it at Superior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/c50f7826f0e8f3250cc6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></td><td>+30%</td><td>5.5–29.2 damage</td><td>+4 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/iron-warmace?q=flawless\" title=\"Show it at Flawless\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/c50f7826f0e8f3250cc6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></td><td>+38%</td><td>5.8–31 damage</td><td>+5.1 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <h2>Getting Inferior ones</h2>\n      <p><b>Crafting</b> (Weapon Smithing 13): the higher above 13 you are, the better the odds, up to +30. <a href=\"#/calc-quality\" data-qe=\"iron-warmace\">Plan it on Quality &amp; enchanting</a></p>\n        <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table\"><thead><tr><th>Your level</th><th><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>13 <span class=\"muted\">(+0)</span></td><td>1.5%</td><td>4.0%</td><td>19.1%</td><td>56.2%</td><td>16.2%</td><td>2.9%</td><td>0.2%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>18 <span class=\"muted\">(+5)</span></td><td>0.5%</td><td>2.4%</td><td>14.2%</td><td>55.7%</td><td>21.4%</td><td>5.1%</td><td>0.7%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>23 <span class=\"muted\">(+10)</span></td><td>0.1%</td><td>1.2%</td><td>10.0%</td><td>52.7%</t